          "short": "$\\frac{93+28\\sqrt{11}}{5}$",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}\\frac{7+2\\sqrt{11}}{7-2\\sqrt{11}}&=\\frac{(7+2\\sqrt{11})^2}{(7-2\\sqrt{11})(7+2\\sqrt{11})}\\\\\\frac{7+2\\sqrt{11}}{7-2\\sqrt{11}}&=\\frac{49+28\\sqrt{11}+44}{49-44}\\\\\\frac{7+2\\sqrt{11}}{7-2\\sqrt{11}}&=\\frac{93+28\\sqrt{11}}{5}\\end{align*}$$",
